      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 已知$y=12.7\\pm0.5$，求数$y$的界。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为$12.7$是$y$的精确到$0.5$的近似值，所以$y$与$12.7$",
        "的差不大于$0.5$。这就是说，",
        "$12.7-0.5\\leqslant y\\leqslant12.7+0.5$，",
        "即",
        "$12.2\\leqslant y\\leqslant13.2$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 已知$2.6\\leqslant x\\leqslant2.9$。取上界与下界的算术平均数作为",
        "$x$的近似值。确定所得到的近似值精确到什么程度。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
